  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Hypersexualization",
  "description": "A disparaging stereotype that portrays Black individuals, particularly men, as hypersexual or sexually aggressive. This stereotype is often used to dehumanize or objectify Black men, particularly in contexts where their physicality is emphasized (e.g., fitness, bodybuilding).",
